## **Conclusion: The Liberation of the Will**

Information is the “oxygen” of the will. Whether a person ingests a spiked drink or lives in a society saturated with classified propaganda, autonomy is compromised. We bear a moral responsibility—to ourselves and others—to restore unaltered reality.

